{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.poster.avif?t=1760155485\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.webm?t=1760155485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/5458c327c5057424d4c3d5d489179a14.mp4?t=1760155485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforced Machine is a fast-paced twin-stick mech shooter where you battle through waves of cyborg creatures. Each mech features unique weapons and skills\u2014equip two skills from six available options to best suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/e9aab113ba96616e3f6c31128f461ffe.poster.avif?t=1760155485\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/e9aab113ba96616e3f6c31128f461ffe.webm?t=1760155485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440860/extras/e9aab113ba96616e3f6c31128f461ffe.mp4?t=1760155485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Reinforced Machine can unleash a powerful ultimate transformation, granting access to devastating legendary weapons and turning the tide of battle. As you master each mech through skill-based progression, you'll unlock their signature abilities. Choose from multiple Reinforced Machines: Combatron, Syntax, Mecha-Simian, Pylon, Firewall, and more!</p>",